Rechargeable battery operation and connectivity options', TRUE, '2026-09-16T07:34:59.815Z', '2026-09-16T07:34:59.815Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('131', 'BM-5DH', 'BM-5DH', 'Analytical balances', 'The BM-5DH Micro Analytical Balance is designed for high-precision weighing applications in hallmarking centres, where accurate measurement is essential. It provides reliable weighing performance for precious metals and other small samples requiring precise measurement. The balance is suitable for professional laboratory and jewellery-related environments where consistency and accuracy are important. Its compact design and precision weighing capability make it convenient for controlled weighing operations. The BM-5DH is an appropriate solution for hallmarking centres looking for dependable micro-analytical weighing equipment.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789544415/weighing-balance/products/fvylefyvmkufuaaxs8yp.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789544417/weighing-balance/products/oaznmblid4ctwejevh3e.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789544412/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/bm.pdf', 'Designed specifically for hallmarking centres
