Suitable for precious metal and jewellery weighing
Compact and professional laboratory design
Reliable and consistent weighing performance', TRUE, '2026-09-16T07:40:29.144Z', '2026-09-16T07:40:29.145Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('132', 'GR-202', 'GR-202', 'Analytical balances', 'The GR-202 Semi-Micro Analytical Balance is designed for precise weighing applications in hallmarking centres, where accurate measurement of precious metals and small samples is essential. It provides dependable weighing performance for professional hallmarking and laboratory environments. The balance is suitable for applications requiring consistent and repeatable measurements. Its semi-micro analytical design supports detailed weighing operations where precision is a key requirement. The GR-202 is a practical weighing solution for hallmarking centres seeking reliable and accurate measurement.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789544676/weighing-balance/products/twaxm4ojb2cbm9dvmqlc.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789544678/weighing-balance/products/umuv20cmrwn1gxmusica.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789544653/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/gr__1_.pdf', 'Designed for hallmarking centre applications
