Professional solution for hallmarking and laboratory use', TRUE, '2026-09-16T07:44:48.286Z', '2026-09-16T07:44:48.286Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('133', 'A&D AD-4212L Series', 'A&D AD-4212L Series', 'Weigh Modules', 'The A&D AD-4212L Series is a compact, high-precision weighing module designed for production-line automation, laboratory equipment, and weighing systems where space is limited. It provides fast and stable weighing with 1 mg readability, high-speed sampling, vibration compensation, and strong overload protection. The separate weighing unit and DIN-rail-mounted display make it easy to integrate into automated equipment and control panels', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620442/weighing-balance/products/r8y2v6nbosmfsbkk7kme.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620445/weighing-balance/products/mokxtpamvbostlvkjqqh.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620394/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ad4212l.pdf', 'High-Speed Sampling: Samples weight data at up to 1,000 times per second for rapid weighing response.
Excellent Vibration Cancellation: Powerful digital filtering helps maintain stable weighing even in environments affected by vibration.
Compact Design: The weighing unit is only 30 mm wide, making it suitable for installation in narrow spaces and automated machinery.
Fast Stabilization: Stabilization can be approximately 0.3 seconds for loads up to 5 g under suitable conditions.
Strong Overload Protection: The weighing sensor incorporates protection against excessive loads and mechanical forces from multiple directions.
Industrial Communication: Supports RS-485 with Modbus-RTU and USB 2.0 for system integration.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T04:47:29.323Z', '2026-09-17T04:47:29.325Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('134', 'AD-4212F Series', 'AD-4212F Series', 'Weigh Modules', 'The A&D AD-4212F Series is a high-capacity precision weighing module designed for automated production lines, industrial weighing systems, filling applications, and system integration. Its compact 80 mm-wide design, integrated A/D converter, high-capacity weighing, and direct digital communication with PLCs or PCs make it suitable for applications where both high weighing capacity and precision are required.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620646/weighing-balance/products/flxmah5orxeklgnoim6h.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620648/weighing-balance/products/dirz3gttvagvyvank1ai.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620637/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ad-4212f.pdf', 'High-Capacity Weighing: Available with capacities from 510 g up to 22 kg, with readability from 0.001 g to 0.1 g depending on the model.
Fast Stabilization: Stabilization can be approximately 0.5 seconds for loads up to 300 g under specified conditions.
IP65 Protection: Dustproof and water-resistant construction helps protect the weighing module from powder and liquid splashes.
Space-Saving Design: The compact 80 mm width allows the unit to be integrated into production equipment and systems with limited installation space.
Smart-Range Function: The AD-4212F-6203D can provide 0.001 g readability up to 510 g, even after tare operation.
Direct PC/PLC Connection: An integrated A/D converter allows digital weighing data to be sent directly to a PC or PLC.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T04:51:02.531Z', '2026-09-17T04:51:02.531Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('135', 'AD-4212D Series', 'AD-4212D Series', 'Weigh Modules', 'The A&D AD-4212D Series is a high-resolution precision weighing module designed for in-line weighing, production-line equipment, draft chambers, glove boxes, and automated dispensing systems. It offers weighing resolution down to 0.001 mg (1 µg) and uses an integrated A/D converter for direct connection to a PC or PLC.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620853/weighing-balance/products/fpbxzhaiv3xpszvi4tmd.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620855/weighing-balance/products/ht9be530mzrk1c4vgd78.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789620836/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ad4212d_brochure.pdf', 'Ultra-High Resolution: Provides readability as low as 0.001 mg (1 µg) for highly precise weighing applications.
Multiple Capacity Options: Available with capacities from 32 g to 320 g, depending on the model.
Direct PC/PLC Connection: Built-in A/D conversion allows weighing data to be output directly to a PC or PLC, reducing the need for a separate display unit.
Internal Calibration: An internal sensitivity adjustment weight allows quick calibration with a simple operation.
Overload Protection: A patented shock-absorbing mechanism helps protect the weighing sensor against vertical and transverse overload caused by equipment or actuator movement.
Compact Design: The weighing unit is designed for integration into production equipment and space-constrained systems.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T04:54:23.060Z', '2026-09-17T04:54:23.060Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('136', 'AD-4212C Series', 'AD-4212C Series', 'Weigh Modules', 'The A&D AD-4212C Series is a high-precision weighing module designed for production-line systems, automated weighing, filling, dispensing, and equipment integration. Its compact 59 mm-wide design, fast stabilization, high-speed digital output, and IP65 dust- and water-resistant construction make it suitable for demanding industrial applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621050/weighing-balance/products/peq6ptd3rtsfnnnm2puh.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621052/weighing-balance/products/zxh1mqt1jhnwbcaaige7.png', '', 'High Precision: Readability ranges from 0.0001 g to 0.01 g, depending on the model.
Fast Stabilization: Stabilizes in as little as 0.5 seconds for suitable loads at 1 mg readability.
Compact Design: Only 59 mm wide, making it suitable for installation in narrow spaces and automated equipment.
Direct Digital Output: Connects directly to a PC, panel computer, or PLC through RS-232C.
High-Speed Data Transmission: Provides weighing data at up to 50 times per second.
IP65 Protection: Dust- and water-resistant construction makes it suitable for powder and liquid weighing applications.
Overload Protection: Includes protection against vertical and transverse overloads that can occur because of actuator malfunctions.
Smart Range Function: Selected models automatically switch between precision and standard weighing ranges according to the load.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T04:57:33.027Z', '2026-09-17T04:57:33.027Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('137', 'AD-4212B Series', 'AD-4212B Series', 'Weigh Modules', 'The A&D AD-4212B Series is a high-precision, compact weighing module designed for automated production lines, pharmaceutical applications, electronic components, coating materials, oils, and other precision weighing systems. Its separate weighing sensor can be integrated into equipment where space is limited, while providing readability down to 0.01 mg.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621234/weighing-balance/products/v0b1zfwvxxnhdxjbtd6s.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621235/weighing-balance/products/iocp11eo61m3vybuvzkl.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621220/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ad4212ab.pdf', 'High-Precision Weighing: Provides readability from 0.01 mg to 0.1 mg, with capacities from 31 g/110 g up to 310 g, depending on the model.
Fast Stabilization: The AD-4212B-101/102 can stabilize in approximately 4 seconds at 0.01 mg readability under suitable conditions.
Compact 80 mm Sensor Unit: The slim separate weighing sensor is only 80 mm wide, making it suitable for compact automated equipment.
Vacuum Chamber Compatible: Designed for installation and weighing applications inside vacuum chambers.
Overload Protection: A protection mechanism helps prevent damage from vertical and transverse overloads, including those caused by actuator malfunctions.
Adjustable Response: Response characteristics can be adjusted to reduce the effects of drafts and vibration.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T05:00:44.124Z', '2026-09-17T05:00:44.124Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('138', 'AD-4212A Series', 'AD-4212A Series', 'Weigh Modules', 'The A&D AD-4212A Series is a compact, high-precision weighing module designed for automated production lines, precision filling, dispensing, checkweighing, and laboratory equipment integration. Its separate weighing sensor and display unit allow flexible installation in space-constrained systems, while fast response and high-resolution weighing provide accurate results for demanding applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621343/weighing-balance/products/lnjj2wio2zi0ohowe3rn.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621345/weighing-balance/products/yrbro15ap8c2pkhuymd6.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789621332/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ad4212ab__1_.pdf', 'High-Precision Weighing: Readability from 0.1 mg to 1 mg, depending on the model.
Fast Stabilization: Stabilization time can be as low as approximately 0.8 seconds under suitable conditions.
Compact Sensor Unit: The weighing unit is only 80 mm wide, making it suitable for compact production equipment.
Overload Protection: Protection against both vertical and transverse overloads helps protect the weighing sensor.
Adjustable Response: Response characteristics can be adjusted to reduce the effects of drafts and vibration.
RS-232C Interface: Standard bidirectional RS-232C communication allows connection to PCs and other equipment.
Flexible Communication: Optional Ethernet (TCP/IP), BCD output, and external contact input are available.
Separate Display: The display unit can be wall- or panel-mounted, allowing flexible system integration.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T05:02:33.477Z', '2026-09-17T05:02:33.477Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('139', 'MS-74A(T) / MX-53A(T) / MF-53A / ML-53A', 'MS-74A(T) / MX-53A(T) / MF-53A / ML-53A', 'Moisture Analyzers', 'The A&D MS-74A(T), MX-53A(T), MF-53A and ML-53A are heat-drying moisture analyzers designed for fast and accurate determination of moisture content in samples. They use a 400 W halogen heater and A&D''s Super Hybrid Sensor (SHS) to provide high-precision weighing and reproducible moisture measurements without chemical reagents.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628063/weighing-balance/products/hextkxwntzkqry6eynps.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628065/weighing-balance/products/vbezi3zqwffi3n5f122r.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789622671/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/mx-a_t__1_.pdf', 'Chemical-Reagent-Free Measurement: Uses heat-drying technology to determine moisture content without chemical reagents.
Wide Temperature Range: Drying temperature can be set from 30°C to 200°C in 1°C increments.
400 W Halogen Heater: Provides fast and powerful heating for shorter measurement times.
Super Hybrid Sensor (SHS): Provides high weighing accuracy and excellent measurement reproducibility.
Optimum Temperature Search (RsTemp): Helps identify a suitable drying temperature for a sample.
Multiple Heating Patterns: Supports standard, ramp, step, and quick heating patterns.
Real-Time Moisture Display: Displays moisture content and drying rate (%/min) during measurement.
Preheating Function: Helps improve consistency between measurements.
Thermal Analysis: Touchscreen models can perform measurements using up to five drying stages.
Programmable Measurements: Up to 300 customized measurement conditions can be stored on touchscreen models and up to 200 on reverse-backlit LCD models.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T06:55:02.574Z', '2026-09-17T06:55:02.574Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('140', 'MS-74A(T) / MX-53A(T) / MF-53A / ML-53A', 'MS-74A(T) / MX-53A(T) / MF-53A / ML-53A', 'Moisture Analyzers', 'The A&D MS-74A(T), MX-53A(T), MF-53A and ML-53A are advanced heat-drying moisture analyzers designed for fast, accurate and repeatable moisture-content measurement. They use a 400 W halogen heating system, Super Hybrid Sensor (SHS) and Secondary Radiation Assist (SRA) to provide uniform heating and reliable moisture analysis without chemical reagents.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628275/weighing-balance/products/lhl6yvztktrgxpfy8sak.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628277/weighing-balance/products/m7ykwkm8my3bipah2rir.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628261/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/mx-a_t__2_.pdf', 'Chemical-Reagent-Free Operation: Determines moisture content using heat-drying technology without chemical reagents.
400 W Halogen Heater: Provides powerful, rapid heating for efficient moisture measurement.
Wide Temperature Range: Adjustable from 30°C to 200°C in 1°C increments.
Optimum Temperature Search (RsTemp): Helps determine a suitable drying temperature for the sample.
Super Hybrid Sensor (SHS): Provides high weighing precision and excellent measurement reproducibility.
Secondary Radiation Assist (SRA): Promotes uniform heating of the sample and helps protect the heating lamp.
Multiple Heating Patterns: Supports standard, ramp, step and quick heating.
Real-Time Moisture Monitoring: Displays moisture content and drying rate during measurement.
Preheating Function: Helps improve consistency between repeated measurements.
Thermal Analysis: Touchscreen models support up to five drying stages.
Programmable Measurements: Up to 300 customized measurement conditions can be stored on touchscreen models and 200 on LCD models.
Comparator Function: Provides HI/OK/LO evaluation according to preset moisture limits.
Data Storage: Stores measurement results and instrument history for traceability.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T06:58:32.581Z', '2026-09-17T06:58:32.581Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('141', 'FG-CWP Series', 'FG-CWP Series', 'Dust & Waterproof Scales', 'The A&D FG-CWP Series is an all-stainless-steel waterproof platform scale designed for fast and reliable weighing in demanding environments such as food processing, manufacturing, warehouses, wet areas, and hygiene-sensitive applications. With IP67 dust and waterproof protection, alcohol-cleanable surfaces, fast 1-second measurement, and multiple weighing resolutions, it is designed for efficient everyday industrial weighing.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628552/weighing-balance/products/bnom2qljmdkiozr1atef.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628555/weighing-balance/products/ych7msipeo5qn5ts4vif.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628536/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/fg-cwp.pdf', 'IP67 Dust & Waterproof: Protects against dust and water and is designed to withstand immersion up to 1 m for 30 minutes.
All Stainless-Steel Construction: The display unit, weighing pan, pole and frame use stainless steel, providing good resistance to corrosion and making cleaning easier.
Alcohol Washable: Suitable surfaces can be cleaned with alcohol diluted to 70% or less, making it useful for hygiene-sensitive environments.
Fast 1-Second Measurement: Provides rapid weighing response at the standard factory resolution setting.
Multiple Weighing Resolutions: Four selectable readability/resolution settings allow the scale to be configured according to the application.
Bright 3-Color Comparator Lights: Makes under / OK / over weighing decisions easy to identify during checkweighing. Up to 10 comparator settings can be stored.
Auto-Tare Function: Automatically performs tare operations when the weight reaches the specified target range, useful for checkweighing and filling applications.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:02:44.232Z', '2026-09-17T07:02:44.232Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('142', 'HV/HW-CWP Series', 'HV/HW-CWP Series', 'Dust & Waterproof Scales', 'The A&D HV/HW-CWP Series is a waterproof stainless-steel platform scale designed for reliable weighing in demanding environments such as food processing, manufacturing, warehouses, production lines, and wet or washdown areas. With IP65 dust and water protection, fast weighing response, multi-color comparator lights, and a wide range of capacities, the series is suitable for both general weighing and industrial checkweighing applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628696/weighing-balance/products/ttpxylkr5on59uw0ag2h.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628698/weighing-balance/products/ck86c5mxecjat33uttxp.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628689/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/hvw-cwp.pdf', 'IP65 Dust & Waterproof: Stainless-steel construction provides protection against dust and water jets from any direction.
Stainless-Steel Construction: SUS304 stainless-steel weighing surfaces are suitable for demanding and hygiene-sensitive environments.
Fast Weighing: HV-CWP models provide a typical response of 1 second or less; HW-CWP models typically respond within about 1.5 seconds.
5-Step LED Comparator: Bright, multi-colored indicator lights make under/OK/over checkweighing easy to identify.
Auto-Tare Function: Supports automatic tare operation for efficient take-away checkweighing.
Negative Comparison: Useful when checking the amount remaining or removed from a container.
Large Backlit LCD: The 26 mm character-height display provides clear visibility, including in dim working areas.
Counting Function: Calculates the number of pieces based on the stored unit weight.
Accumulation (M+) Function: Adds multiple weighing results and displays the accumulated total.
Display Hold: Holds the displayed weight for easier reading when the weighing item is difficult to observe.
Key Lock: Prevents unauthorized operators from changing important scale settings.
Adjustable Display Angle: The display can be positioned for convenient viewing.
Detachable Display: The display unit can be detached and mounted separately using an optional holder.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:05:04.015Z', '2026-09-17T07:05:04.015Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('143', 'SW Series', 'SW Series', 'Bench Scales', 'The A&D SW Series is a super washdown stainless-steel bench scale designed for demanding environments where frequent high-pressure cleaning, water exposure, and hygiene are important. With IP69K and IP68 protection, stainless-steel construction, fast weighing, and checkweighing functions, it is particularly suited to food processing, pharmaceutical, chemical, and other wet industrial applications', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628873/weighing-balance/products/ecca48fzf6rlsp9pt5tc.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628875/weighing-balance/products/gocqjdauvmh0qzcviuwa.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789628869/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/SW_brochure_revised.pdf', 'IP69K Super Washdown Protection: Designed to withstand high-pressure, high-temperature water cleaning, including water at approximately 8,000–10,000 kPa and 80 ± 5°C from close range.
IP68 Protection: Provides protection against water ingress during immersion up to 1 meter for 24 hours under the specified test conditions.
Stainless-Steel Construction: The weighing pan and frame are SUS304 stainless steel, while the load cell is SUS630, providing durability and corrosion resistance.
Easy-to-Clean Design: Streamlined construction helps remove food-processing residues and reduces areas where contamination can accumulate.
Fast Weighing: Provides weighing results in approximately 1 second, helping improve productivity in repetitive weighing operations.
5-Step Comparator Display: Bright multi-color LED indicators make it easy to identify whether a weight is under, within, or above the target range.
Auto-Tare Function: Automatically performs tare operations for convenient consecutive checkweighing.
Counting Function: Calculates the number of pieces from the stored unit weight, making it useful for parts and component counting.
Touch-Sensitive Keys: Capacitive keys reduce the risk of damage from sharp objects and are suitable for demanding working environments.
Adjustable Indicator: The indicator bracket can be adjusted to 0°, 30°, 60° or 90° for comfortable viewing.
Multiple Communication Options: Optional RS-232C and RS-422/485 interfaces are available for connecting computers, printers and other equipment.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:07:59.220Z', '2026-09-17T07:07:59.220Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('144', 'SC Series', 'SC Series', 'Bench Scales', 'The A&D SC Series is an IP68 stainless-steel washdown platform scale designed for accurate weighing in wet, dusty and demanding industrial environments. Its fully washable construction, submersible design, fast 1-second stabilization and long battery life make it suitable for food processing, manufacturing, warehouses, chemical industries and other washdown applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629032/weighing-balance/products/r9cn69vcnyttwzugaaww.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629034/weighing-balance/products/ztq7bzxem3wzonuyipte.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629029/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/scse.pdf', 'Washdown Construction: Designed for easy cleaning with water, helping maintain hygiene in demanding workplaces.
Stainless-Steel Construction: The weighing platform and pan are made from SUS304 stainless steel for durability and corrosion resistance.
Fast 1-Second Stabilization: Provides quick weighing results for efficient repetitive weighing operations.
Long Battery Life: Six D-size alkaline batteries can provide up to 5,000 hours of continuous operation under specified conditions.
Large LCD Display: Features a 39 mm character height for easy reading from a distance.
Waterproof Load Cell: The load cell is designed to resist water and corrosion.
Counting Function: Can be used to count parts and components based on stored unit weight.
Comparator Function: Supports weighing checks against preset limits.
Auto Power-Off: Helps conserve battery power when the scale is not being used.
Battery Indicator: Displays remaining battery status.
Removable Battery Unit: Makes battery replacement and maintenance convenient.
Bluetooth Communication: Optional Bluetooth connectivity is available for wireless data transmission.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:10:40.554Z', '2026-09-17T07:10:40.554Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('145', 'SE Series', 'SE Series', 'Bench Scales', 'The A&D SE Series is an IP68 waterproof washdown platform scale designed for reliable weighing in wet, dusty and demanding industrial environments. It combines fast weighing, a large easy-to-read LCD display, stainless-steel weighing pan and long battery operation, making it suitable for food processing, manufacturing, warehouses and general industrial applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629266/weighing-balance/products/jhhlalrtk3xxcs6og6jh.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629268/weighing-balance/products/si0dbzsai74thsbmlsxk.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629237/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/scse__1_.pdf', 'IP68 Dust & Waterproof: Can be immersed to a depth of 1 meter for up to 24 hours under specified conditions.
Washdown Construction: Designed for easy cleaning in wet and hygiene-sensitive working environments.
Fast Weighing: Provides stabilization in approximately 1 second.
Long Battery Life: Operates for up to 5,000 hours using six D-size alkaline batteries under specified conditions.
Large LCD Display: Features a 39 mm character height for clear visibility.
Stainless-Steel Weighing Pan: Uses SUS430 stainless steel for durability and corrosion resistance.
Waterproof Load Cell: Designed with protection against water and corrosion.
Counting Function: Allows the scale to determine the number of pieces based on stored unit weight.
Comparator Function: Indicates whether the measured weight is below, within or above preset limits.
Auto Power-Off: Automatically switches off the display after a period of inactivity to conserve battery power.
Battery Indicator: Shows the remaining battery level.
Removable Battery Unit: Makes battery replacement easier.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:14:34.806Z', '2026-09-17T07:14:34.806Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('146', 'GC Series', 'GC Series', 'Counting Scales', 'The A&D GC Series is a professional counting scale designed for fast and accurate counting of small parts, components, hardware and other items. It combines precision weighing with advanced unit-weight management, making it suitable for inventory control, warehouses, manufacturing, production lines and parts counting.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629474/weighing-balance/products/my2gbkmawbbuflnhdl2p.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629479/weighing-balance/products/wqnbncj28pj9oucfogqc.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629469/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/gc.pdf', 'Automatic Item Search (AIS): Quickly identifies the appropriate stored unit weight for the item being counted.
High Internal Memory: Stores data for up to 1,000 items, making it convenient for inventory and production applications.
Fine Counting Mode: Provides very small minimum unit weights for improved counting accuracy.
ACAI Function: Automatic Counting Accuracy Improvement helps improve counting precision as additional samples are weighed.
Three LCD Displays + OLED: Separate displays show count, weight and unit weight, while the OLED provides operating information and guidance.
Multiple Unit-Weight Setting Methods: Unit weights can be entered using several convenient methods, including sample counting and numerical entry.
WinCT-Counting Software: Free software helps manage item and unit-weight data on a PC.
MicroSD Memory Expansion: Storage can be expanded using a MicroSD card.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:18:24.459Z', '2026-09-17T07:18:24.459Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('147', 'FC-i/FC-Si Series', 'FC-i/FC-Si Series', 'Counting Scales', 'The A&D FC-i / FC-Si Series is a high-precision counting scale designed for accurate counting of small parts, components, hardware, electronic parts and industrial products. It combines high internal resolution, Automatic Counting Accuracy Improvement (ACAI), large item memory and flexible communication options, making it suitable for inventory management, production, warehousing and quality-control applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629618/weighing-balance/products/sy3i2htovfns7xjo6k2s.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629620/weighing-balance/products/dz5txyb7dkmkyaibo9o3.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789629601/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/fc-si.pdf', 'High-Precision Counting: FC-Si models provide internal resolution up to 1/10,000,000, while FC-i models provide 1/1,000,000 internal resolution.
ACAI Function: Automatic Counting Accuracy Improvement continuously improves counting accuracy by updating the average piece weight as additional samples are added.
Unit Weight Registration Navigator: LED indicators guide the operator through the unit-weight registration process, making setup simple.
500-Item Memory: Stores up to 500 item IDs, including unit weight, tare weight, upper/lower limits and accumulated quantity.
Multiple Sampling Methods: Unit weight can be established using fixed sample quantities, random samples, keypad entry, stored memory or a PC.
Large Count Display: FC-Si models provide a maximum count display of up to 9,999,999, while FC-i models support up to 1,000,000.
Two-Scale Counting System: An optional remote-scale interface allows a second weighing platform to be connected for larger or heavier items.
Comparator with Buzzer: Helps quickly identify under, OK and over conditions during checkweighing and counting.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:20:24.417Z', '2026-09-17T07:20:24.417Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('148', 'HC-i Series', 'HC-i Series', 'Counting Scales', 'The A&D HC-i Series is a high-performance counting scale designed for accurate and efficient counting of small parts, components, hardware and other items. It combines high internal resolution with Automatic Counting Accuracy Improvement (ACAI), an easy unit-weight registration system and target-counting assistance, making it suitable for inventory, warehouse, manufacturing and production applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789630242/weighing-balance/products/agwwsmm7v9gu0zxxx6oq.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789630244/weighing-balance/products/coqvkbau186w2fa5iqmy.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789630219/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/hc-i.pdf', 'High Internal Resolution: Up to 1/750,000 internal resolution for accurate counting of small components.
Fine Counting Mode: Can count items with minimum unit weights down to 0.005 g on the HC-3Ki.
ACAI Function: Automatically improves counting accuracy by correcting variations in individual piece weights.
Unit Weight Registering Navigator: LED indicators guide the operator step-by-step when registering unit weight.
Audible Weighing Assist (AWA): Beeping frequency increases as the measured quantity approaches the preset target.
99-Item Memory: Stores up to 99 unit-weight records, including tare weight and comparator limits.
Detachable Display: The display can be separated from the weighing platform for flexible installation.
Large Stainless-Steel Pan: A 300 × 210 mm weighing pan provides sufficient space for industrial counting applications.
Comparator Function: Displays HI / OK / LO and provides a buzzer for target checking.
Accumulation Function: Adds multiple counting results and stores the total quantity.
Multiple Unit-Weight Entry Methods: Unit weight can be established using sample weighing, ID memory or keyboard entry.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:30:56.060Z', '2026-09-17T07:30:56.060Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('149', 'HT-120', 'HT-120', 'Compact Scales', 'The A&D HT-120 is a compact and portable precision scale designed for laboratories, schools, jewelry shops, small-part weighing and general precision weighing applications. It offers a 120 g capacity with 0.01 g readability, along with a stainless-steel weighing pan, backlit LCD and long battery life.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789630385/weighing-balance/products/zfawbqhbkylsie1obmqc.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789630386/weighing-balance/products/fwspi3ytvpkh3wpnkpnu.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789630381/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ht-120_brochure.pdf', 'High Precision: 120 g weighing capacity with 0.01 g readability and 0.01 g repeatability.
Compact & Portable: Lightweight design with dimensions of approximately 136 × 150 × 57.5 mm, making it easy to carry and store.
Stainless-Steel Pan: Hygienic and chemically resistant SUS304 stainless-steel Ø70 mm weighing pan.
Long Battery Life: Provides up to 500 hours of operation with four AA alkaline batteries when the backlight is off.
Large Backlit LCD: Features a 15 mm character height with a clear white backlight for easy reading.
Multiple Weighing Units: Supports units including g, oz, ozt, ct, mom, dwt, grain, tola, tael and Newton.
Tare Function: Allows the weight of containers to be easily deducted with one key press.
Auto Power-Off: Automatically switches off after inactivity to conserve battery power.
Battery Indicator: Shows the remaining battery level.
Stackable Carrying Case: The supplied case makes transportation and storage convenient while saving space.
External Calibration: Supports calibration using an external calibration weight.
Security Slot: Built-in security slot allows an anti-theft lock to be attached.
AC Adapter Option: Can be operated using an optional AC adapter', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:33:09.563Z', '2026-09-17T07:33:09.563Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "model", "name", "category", "description", "brand_image_url", "image_url", "pdf_url", "features", "status", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('150', 'HT Series', 'HT Series', 'Compact Scales', 'The A&D HT Series is a range of compact, portable digital scales designed for everyday weighing applications where simple operation, portability and reliable accuracy are important. The series includes models from 120 g up to 5.1 kg capacity, making it suitable for laboratories, education, retail, small parts, general weighing and other light-duty applications.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789631152/weighing-balance/products/iwgwln0hdqmcg0fljll1.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789631154/weighing-balance/products/syoum8d8m3ce0utiwbvf.png', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/hehl57yx/image/upload/v1789631132/weighing-balance/products/pdfs/ht.pdf', 'Wide Capacity Range: Models are available from 120 g to 5,100 g, depending on the model.
Good Readability: Readability ranges from 0.01 g to 1 g, depending on the model.
Large LCD Display: Easy-to-read 13.5 mm characters provide clear weight indication.
Long Battery Life: Provides approximately 450 hours of operation using alkaline batteries.
Multiple Weighing Units: Supports units such as g, oz, ozt, lb-oz, tael, tola and Newton, depending on model.
Tare Function: Allows the container weight to be deducted easily with a single operation.
Auto Power-Off: Automatically turns the display off after approximately 5 minutes of inactivity to conserve battery power.
Portable Design: Compact and lightweight construction makes the scale easy to transport and store.
Stackable Carrying Case: The supplied case can be stacked to save storage space.
Removable Weighing Pan: The pan can be removed for convenient cleaning.
Optional Stainless-Steel Pan: A SUS304 stainless-steel pan is available as an option.
Two Power Options: Operates using 4 AA batteries or an optional AC adapter.
Security Slot: A rear security slot allows an anti-theft lock to be fitted.', TRUE, '2026-09-17T07:45:57.059Z', '2026-09-17T07:45:57.059Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET "model" = EXCLUDED."model", "name" = EXCLUDED."name", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "description" = EXCLUDED."description", "brand_image_url" = EXCLUDED."brand_image_url", "image_url" = EXCLUDED."image_url", "pdf_url" = EXCLUDED."pdf_url", "features" = EXCLUDED."features", "status" = EXCLUDED."status", "updated_at" = EXCLUDED."updated_at";
